5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am curious about the ground. It feels important to know what is under our feet before we start.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,Hello everyone. I am here to look at the numbers. I want to see what this will cost us later.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good morning, dear. I have seen many plans come and go. I want to see what remains.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I am thinking about who will actually do the work. The staff numbers seem low to me.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,Let us not guess. We need data on how people actually use this space right now.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, do you have any specific figures in mind? I am just trying to understand the scope.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, I am looking at the long-term maintenance. The initial price is never the whole story.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I agree with May. Pretty pictures fade. I want to see the condition of past work.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I am checking the staffing. If we cannot staff it, it will fail. Who is left to care for it?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the staffing is a factor, but the physical layout matters more. I am checking the traffic.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,I am worried about the digging. The soil here can be tricky. I want to check the firms.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,I will look at the upkeep ledger. I need to see the real cost per hectare.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I will look at the earlier programme. I want to see what survived the last decade.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,I will look at the groundskeeping roll. I need to know exactly who is on the payroll.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the timed counts. I need to see where the people actually walk.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also check the drainage. Water is always a problem in this city.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I will also check the habitat fund terms. I need to know what is actually funded.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the eastern avenue planting. I want to see if the trees survived.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will also check the volunteer groups. They might be the real workforce.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the depot phasing notes. I need to know how we can keep the park open.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
