31,2,,status,Minato,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Victoria,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Minato,,The firms are worried about the clay. They say the ground is risky for big digging.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,May,,The habitat fund only pays for plants and water. It does not cover paving or buildings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Shizue,,"The old basin is fine, but the apron outside the hall has been patched three times.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Victoria,,We only have seven staff left. The rest is bought in or volunteers. It is a thin line.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,People walk on the hard ground to get to the tram. They avoid the soft edges.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@May, that fund restriction is tight. It means we can't build much.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,May,,"@Minato, exactly. If we want a plaza, we pay for it all. If we want trees, the fund helps.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Shunichi, that makes sense. People want a direct path. They don't want to wander.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, the volunteers are good, but they are casual. We can't rely on them for daily care.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, the volunteers handle weekends. The staff handle weekdays. It is a split system.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,The drainage callouts have doubled. The heat is also higher here than on the streets.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,May,,The upkeep for planted ground is triple the cost of hard surfaces. The gap is growing.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Shizue,,Half the trees on the avenue died. No one watered them. That is a failure of care.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Victoria,,"The volunteer groups are active, but they are specific. One does habitat, one does sports.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"The phasing notes say we can hoard the south, but not the center. We must keep the gate open.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,"This is tricky. The ground is bad, and the heat is high. We need to be careful.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,May,,The costs are high for nature. We need to be realistic about what we can afford to maintain.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Shizue,,"We must learn from the past. If we don't plan for care, it will die.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Victoria,,"We have the people, but they are limited. We need a plan that fits their capacity.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,We need a plan that works with the traffic and the ground. Not against them.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
